---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PartnerBadges from '../../components/PartnerBadges.astro';

const schema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "Article",
      "headline": "From £255 to £16 CPL: Architecture Leads Case Study",
      "description": "How Visible Ads reduced Cost Per Lead from £255 to £16 and increased lead volume by 251% for a luxury architectural finishes brand.",
      "url": "https://visible-ads.optimisedwebsite.com/blog/luxury-architecture-case-study",
      "datePublished": "2026-02-13",
      "dateModified": "2026-02-13",
      "author": { "@type": "Person", "name": "Joe Short" },
      "publisher": { "@type": "Organization", "name": "Visible Ads", "url": "https://visible-ads.optimisedwebsite.com" },
      "image": "https://visible-ads.optimisedwebsite.com/images/visible-ads-og.png"
    },
    {
      "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
      "itemListElement": [
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://visible-ads.optimisedwebsite.com/" },
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Blog", "item": "https://visible-ads.optimisedwebsite.com/blog" },
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "Luxury Architecture Case Study", "item": "https://visible-ads.optimisedwebsite.com/blog/luxury-architecture-case-study" }
      ]
    }
  ]
};
---

<Layout title="£255 to £16 CPL: Architecture Leads | Visible Ads" description="How Visible Ads reduced Cost Per Lead from £255 to £16 and increased lead volume by 251% for a luxury architectural finishes brand." schema={schema}>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-gradient-to-br from-navy to-navy-light relative overflow-hidden" data-animate>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 dot-pattern opacity-5"></div>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative">
      <nav class="text-sm text-slate-light mb-8">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Home</a>
        <span class="mx-2">/</span>
        <a href="/blog" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Blog</a>
        <span class="mx-2">/</span>
        <span class="text-white">Luxury Architecture Case Study</span>
      </nav>
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <span class="inline-block px-4 py-1.5 bg-electric/20 text-electric-light text-sm font-medium rounded-full mb-6">Case Study</span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-heading font-extrabold text-white leading-tight mb-6">From £255 to £16 CPL: Transforming Lead Generation for Luxury Architectural Finishes</h1>
        <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-slate-light leading-relaxed">How we slashed Cost Per Lead by 94% and increased lead volume by 251% — turning an unsustainable campaign into a predictable growth engine.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Key Results -->
  <section class="py-16 lg:py-20 bg-white" data-animate>
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-8">Results at a Glance</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-8">
        <div class="bg-sky-tint rounded-2xl p-6 text-center">
          <p class="text-3xl font-heading font-extrabold text-electric mb-2">£16</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 font-medium">Cost Per Lead (from £255)</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-sky-tint rounded-2xl p-6 text-center">
          <p class="text-3xl font-heading font-extrabold text-electric mb-2">428</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 font-medium">Total Leads (5 months)</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-sky-tint rounded-2xl p-6 text-center">
          <p class="text-3xl font-heading font-extrabold text-electric mb-2">+251%</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 font-medium">Lead Volume Increase YoY</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Challenge -->
  <section class="py-16 lg:py-20 bg-sky-tint" data-animate>
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-6">The Challenge: Unsustainable Acquisition Costs</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">In the luxury architectural finishes sector, lead generation is the difference between a thriving order book and a quiet showroom. When Visible Ads took over this account in late April 2025, the client was facing a staggering Cost Per Lead of £255. For most businesses, these figures are simply unsustainable.</p>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">The challenge was not a lack of market demand — it was a <a href="/google-ads" class="text-electric underline hover:text-electric-dark">Google Ads</a> strategy that had become prohibitively expensive through poor targeting and campaign structure.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Immediate Impact -->
  <section class="py-16 lg:py-20 bg-white" data-animate>
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-6">The Turning Point: Immediate Impact</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">Our first priority was to stabilise the account. By refining targeting and overhauling the campaign structure to better suit high-end architectural products, results came almost immediately. Within the first full month of management, we reduced the CPL from £255 down to £35.22.</p>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Through continuous optimisation and rigorous data analysis, we pushed CPL consistently below £20. January 2026 proved to be the strongest month on record, with CPL dropping to just £16.38.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- YoY Comparison -->
  <section class="py-16 lg:py-20 bg-sky-tint" data-animate>
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-6">Year-on-Year Comparison (Sept-Jan)</h2>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-8">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse">
          <thead>
            <tr class="border-b-2 border-electric/20">
              <th class="py-3 pr-4 font-heading font-bold text-navy">Metric</th>
              <th class="py-3 px-4 font-heading font-bold text-navy">Sept 2024 - Jan 2025</th>
              <th class="py-3 px-4 font-heading font-bold text-navy">Sept 2025 - Jan 2026</th>
              <th class="py-3 pl-4 font-heading font-bold text-navy">Change</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="text-gray-700">
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="py-3 pr-4">Total Leads</td><td class="py-3 px-4">122</td><td class="py-3 px-4">428</td><td class="py-3 pl-4 font-bold text-green-700">+251%</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="py-3 pr-4">Cost Per Lead</td><td class="py-3 px-4">£71.40</td><td class="py-3 px-4">£20.43</td><td class="py-3 pl-4 font-bold text-green-700">-71%</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">The 428 leads consisted of a healthy mix of high-intent actions: 295 sample requests, 44 direct phone calls, and 89 tracked email clicks. Each lead type aligns with the luxury buying journey, where a sample request is often the first step toward a high-value order.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How We Did It -->
  <section class="py-16 lg:py-20 bg-white" data-animate>
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-6">How Visible Ads Delivers for Luxury Brands</h2>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-4">Precision Targeting</h3>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">We do not chase clicks — we chase high-intent customers. By focusing on the specific intent behind each search, we ensure budget is spent on users looking for premium quality and specialist finishes, not general enquiries that waste time and money.</p>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-4">Continuous Optimisation</h3>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">We are never satisfied with "good enough". Constant iteration on campaign performance drives CPL down over time, allowing you to get more value from every pound spent. The trajectory from £255 to £16 demonstrates what sustained optimisation achieves.</p>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-4">Scaling with Certainty</h3>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">By tracking everything from sample requests to direct calls, we provide clear, data-backed projections. We help you understand exactly how much room there is to grow, removing the guesswork from your marketing spend.</p>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-4">Specialist Sector Knowledge</h3>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">We understand the nuances of luxury finishes. A "lead" in this industry often starts with a technical enquiry or sample request, and we build conversion funnels that support that high-end customer journey from first click to final order.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Partner Badges -->
  <section class="py-12 bg-sky-tint border-y border-gray-100" data-animate>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <PartnerBadges compact />
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="relative py-20 lg:py-28 bg-navy" data-animate>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 dot-pattern opacity-5"></div>
    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-heading font-bold text-white mb-6">Could Your Campaigns Work This Hard?</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-light mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Get a free audit and discover how much you could reduce your cost per lead.</p>
      <a href="/free-ads-audit" class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-cta text-white font-semibold px-10 py-4 rounded-xl hover:bg-electric transition-colors text-lg">Get Your Free Ads Audit</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
